https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/37e5152245bbd3ba16709e639c797ef648ea47f9/lib/internal/modules/cjs/loader.js#L714
Since the function does not check the built-in module "node:" prefix, unnecessary operations occur. It will directly return "null" if changed as follows;
` (
      StringPrototypeStartsWith(request, 'node:') &&
      BuiltinModule.canBeRequiredByUsers(StringPrototypeSlice(request, 5))
    ) || (
      BuiltinModule.canBeRequiredByUsers(request) &&
      BuiltinModule.canBeRequiredWithoutScheme(request)
    )`
